    { question: "Do you work in buildings with condominium rules?", answer: "Yes, we have extensive experience working in residential and commercial buildings in Caracas. We know the rules of the main condominiums in Chacao, Baruta, El Hatillo and Sucre, and we manage the necessary permits." },
    { question: "How long does a remodel take in Caracas?", answer: "It depends on the project: a kitchen takes 3-4 weeks, a bathroom 2-3 weeks, and a full remodel 2-3 months. We always set a clear schedule before starting." },
    { question: "Do you offer a warranty on the work?", answer: "Yes, all our work includes a written warranty. We use first-quality materials and skilled labor to guarantee lasting results." },
